{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/6d4ff38a221d9121337c51884af230fa.avif?t=1768343772\" width=1215 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THOUSANDS OF EVIL ALIEN MONSTERS ATTACK CONSTANTLY! BE ON YOUR TOES, STEER THE MASSES AND REACT FAST TO ENEMY AMBUSHES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 unique enemy types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 weapons</strong> to find on your mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless hordes want to eat you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid <strong>constant laser fire, rockets and mortars!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your back at all times! (especially <strong>in the dark</strong>)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/21596744369d675f23d8da2ae9c9cb57.poster.avif?t=1768343772\" width=800 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/21596744369d675f23d8da2ae9c9cb57.webm?t=1768343772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/21596744369d675f23d8da2ae9c9cb57.mp4?t=1768343772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/740c63d1e772bada175e7cc13944cd75.avif?t=1768343772\" width=1215 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTOMATIC CHAINGUN TOWERS, HEAVY ARMED TRUCKS, HUGE DEFENSE TURRETS.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a handcrafted\u00a0<strong>Campaign</strong> and <strong>Horde Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>turrets</strong> and <strong>chaingun trucks</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different locations and find <strong>secret areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>explosives and turrets</strong> to your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill up</strong> your characters abilities: Health, Strength, Accuracy and Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave nothing but a bloody mess behind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/3819f55287fc6e30c9743b061a937a13.poster.avif?t=1768343772\" width=800 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/3819f55287fc6e30c9743b061a937a13.webm?t=1768343772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/3819f55287fc6e30c9743b061a937a13.mp4?t=1768343772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/853449893ca9a0577c47735fbec8efeb.avif?t=1768343772\" width=1215 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD, BODIES, BULLET CASINGS... ALL DESTRUCTION STAYS FOREVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of <strong>chunks, splats, smoke and f